{
  "_doc": "Fabricator recipes. Content is data: add an entry here and it can be crafted. id: the recipe id, same as its output item. output: item id (a component, a material or an item from data/items.json) and count. materials: id -> count, paid from cargo when the job is queued. fab_level: 1 to 4, the fabricator level needed (see workshop modules). tools: tools the fabricator's room must provide, e.g. laser_cutter. time: seconds of crafting. category: system, module, gear (items.json gear and ammo) or material. start_known: recipes known at the start; every other recipe is a blueprint to unlock by scanning and salvage. Special gear (exosuits, unique guns) has no recipe on purpose: it is only found, bought or earned.",
